        "对于 $\\lambda_1 = 1$：$(A-I)\\mathbf{v} = \\begin{pmatrix} 0.3 & 0.9 \\\\ 0.9 & 2.7 \\end{pmatrix}\\mathbf{v} = \\mathbf{0}$，得 $v_1 = -3v_2$",
        "取特征向量 $\\mathbf{v}_1 = \\begin{pmatrix} -3 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$，正规化：$\\mathbf{v}_1^{(n)} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\begin{pmatrix} -3 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$",
