        "重新计算：$B^{(1,1)} = \\frac{1}{10}((-3)(-3) + 2 \\cdot 2) = \\frac{9+4}{10} = \\frac{13}{10}$（这会导致 $B^2 \\ne A$）",
        "正确的方法是：$B = \\begin{pmatrix} 1.1 & 0.3 \\\\ 0.3 & 1.9 \\end{pmatrix}$",
        "验证：$B^2 = \\begin{pmatrix} 1.1^2 + 0.3^2 & 1.1 \\times 0.3 + 0.3 \\times 1.9 \\\\ 0.3 \\times 1.1 + 1.9 \\times 0.3 & 0.3^2 + 1.9^2 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1.3 & 0.9 \\\\ 0.9 & 3.7 \\end{pmatrix} = A$ ✓",
